OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be cloudy with outbreaks of rain.
OL,7,FThen the rest of the night will be
OL,8,Fcloudy with further spells of rain,
OL,9,Fperhaps heavy in the southeast later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FA cloudy day with further
OL,12,Fspells of rain, perhaps some warm
OL,13,Fsunshine breaking through across the
OL,14,Fsoutheast at times.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,17,Ffor most of Thursday but rain
OL,18,Fspreading east later. Mainly dry and
OL,19,Fbright on Friday and Saturday, perhaps
OL,20,Fsome further rain later on Saturday.
